      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "Hãy nói từ từ nhé answers the traveler question \"Please say it slowly\" in moments when Vietnamese stops making sense. This is for when the conversation is stuck and you need a clearer next step fast. Its job is putting the need first and leaving room for the helper to confirm the detail. Expect a confirmation, a handoff, a price, or a follow-up question; then use Explore next if the reply creates another small task.",
