      "body": "Start with Hãy nói từ từ nhé when \"Please say it slowly\" is the main thing you need understood. This is for when the conversation is stuck and you need a clearer next step fast. It gives the other person room to answer with a confirmation, a handoff, a price, or a follow-up question. If speech still does not land, move to writing, pointing, or showing the exact word on your phone.",
